<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wendy's downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wendy's downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jeffries &amp; Co said on Wednesday it lowered its rating on Wendy's International inc to accumulate from buy, because of share valuation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst David Rose said in a research note the shares had reached his near-term price target.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Wendy's continues to benefit from the ongoing consolidation within the quick-serve category while strengthening its position in the sector with new products and a continued emphasis on execution,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Wendy's shares were up 1/8 at 25-1/2.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
